'''Vahlokzin''' is a grey [[ON:Dragon|dragon]] who has made his lair in [[ON:Vahlokzin's Lair|a dormant volcano]] near the coast of [[ON:Southern Elsweyr|Southern Elsweyr]]. He stole the [[Lore:Horn of Ja'darri|Horn of Ja'darri]], willingly given by his brother, from the [[ON:Dragonguard|Dragonguard]]. He is able to use his roars to stir [[ON:Kwama|kwama]] into a violent frenzy which overwhelmed and killed the [[ON:Dragonguard Remains|Dragonguard soldiers]] sent to retrieve the horn and still act as his defenders.
