==Notes==
* Vahlokzin can either be translated from [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]] as ''Spring-Rise/Sky-Honor (vah-lok-zin)'', or ''Guardian-Honor (vahlok-zin)''. Later during [[Online:The Dragon's Lair|The Dragon's Lair]], [[Online:Nahfahlaar|Nahfahlaar]] stresses his name as Vah-lok-zin, hinting that it's the former meaning.
* He shares the same gray model as generic flame dragons in [[ON:Northern Elsweyr|Northern Elsweyr]].
